(52, 'Amana', 'Amana', 'amana, established in 2010 and headquartered in Dubai, stands as a leading MENA neo-broker, with a thriving community that reaches over 350,000+ customers in 80 countries.', 'amana, established in 2010 and headquartered in Dubai, stands as a leading MENA neo-broker, with a thriving community that reaches over 350,000+ customers in 80 countries.', NULL, NULL, 'Dubai,UK', 0, 'https://amana.app/', 'content/companies/69780d15-3b00-4e89-9afe-578c1b675882.jpeg', 1, 'DFSA,CySEC,FSC,FCA- United Kingdom', '3', 'Top 100 Member', 177, '2025-08-05 13:48:58', '2025-08-12 08:34:21'),
