(331, 'Domenico', 'DBINVESTING SCAM', 'dellaportadomenico@tiscali.it', '3386803168', 'In 2018, the authority blocked two cloned sites, www.dubaifxm.com and www.dubaifxm24.com, both linked to Dubai Fxm Ltd. The broker is not based in Dubai, but in Vanuatu, where it obtained a license from the VFSC (Vanuatu Financial Services).\r\n- Financial abuse: Consob obscures 6 websites, DBFX Limited (website www.dbfxtrades.com)\r\n- Comunicato stampa del 2 marzo 2023 - AREA PUBBLICA\r\n2 mar 2023 ... New Finance LLC e NewFx Limited (sito www.newfx.us);; Axi24\" (sito ... I provvedimenti adottati dalla Consob sono consultabili sul sito www.consob \r\n- Comunicazione Consob del 2023-12-07 - AREA PUBBLICA\r\n7 dic 2023 ... Interactive (sito https://inter-active.io e relativa pagina https://inter-active.solutions);; Forexelite Limited ed Elite Trading Academy (sito \r\n- https://www.cybercriminal.com/threats/gennaro-lanza\r\n- https://www.yellow.com.mt/zip-repair/\r\nIt can continue until today, he has never taken responsibility for his ACTIONS.\r\n\r\nTHE WORLD WATCHES YOU AND JUDGES THE STEPS YOU TAKE.', '2025-11-10 10:52:12', '2025-11-10 10:52:12'),
