(742, 'Michael Barkley', 'Quick Question', 'mollie.barkley@googlemail.com', '890654809', 'Hi there,\r\n\r\nI was reviewing your website, not sure how many employees you have, but this might be a great way to encourage your team while helping them improve their health at the same time.\r\n\r\nWe created the EleRing fitness tracker, now available at 50% off, just $59 instead of $120. \r\n\r\nThe EleRIng is a powerful, all-day wearable fitness tracker worn on the finger. It helps people stay on top of their health, energy, and daily activity—without changing their routine.\r\n\r\nInterested in learning more, Visit us here: https://elebands.odoo.com\r\n\r\nEmployees can use EleRing to:\r\n\r\n- Track health data throughout the day\r\n- Improve fitness and daily activity\r\n- Support weight loss goals\r\n- Better understand sleep and recovery\r\n\r\nJust imagine how happy your team would be to receive an EleRing. We’ve found people value tools like this far more than typical swag—because they actually use it every day.\r\n\r\nReady to try the EleRing for yourself? Visit us here: https://elebands.odoo.com \r\n\r\nBest,\r\n\r\nMichael', '2026-04-04 07:34:13', '2026-04-04 07:34:13'),
