(830, 'Jay Winchcombe', 'Let customers ask questions without forcing them through menus', 'winchcombe.jay@yahoo.com', '08609386731', 'Hey there,\r\n\r\nYour competitors are teaching AI their business\r\n\r\nRight now, businesses in every industry are training AI to:\r\n\r\n- Respond to customer questions without delay\r\n- Capture leads automatically\r\n- Qualify buyers\r\n- Handle repetitive support\r\n- Replace friction on websites\r\n\r\nMeanwhile most websites still depend on:\r\n\r\n- Browse page after page\r\n- Navigate menus instead of asking direct questions\r\n- Fill out a form before getting any useful response\r\n\r\nThat model is dying.\r\n\r\nThe companies training AI now are building tomorrow\'s customer-attention advantage.\r\n\r\nVisitors do not want to hunt through a website. They want to ask and get answers.\r\nAnd businesses that cannot respond instantly will lose to businesses that can.\r\n\r\nSee it in action now: \r\nhttps://theolleh.com\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n— Jay Winchcombe\r\nOlleh AI\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nShould you decide not to receive any more communications from this message, just fill the form at brnd .li/delist url with your domain address (URL).\r\n24 Essex Rd, Dobbs Ferry, CA, USA, 90606', '2026-06-02 02:00:10', '2026-06-02 02:00:10'),
