(975, 'Trey Web', 'forextraderssummit.com - Website Audit & Improvement Opportunities', 'trey.justice654@gmail.com', '2102102101', 'Hello forextraderssummit.com,\r\n\r\nI recently reviewed your website forextraderssummit.com, and noticed a few issues that may be limiting your online visibility, search rankings, and conversion potential.\r\n\r\nI can send you a detailed report that includes:\r\n\r\n• Screenshots of the issues identified\r\n• A professional website audit\r\n• Recommendations to improve performance and user experience\r\n• Strategies to increase traffic and generate more leads\r\n• Pricing and implementation options\r\n\r\nThere may be significant opportunities to improve your website\'s results with a few targeted changes.\r\n\r\nIf you\'d like to receive the report, simply reply to this email and I\'ll send it over.\r\n\r\nKind regards,', '2026-07-23 13:53:38', '2026-07-23 13:53:38'),
(976, 'Georges', 'EMEA Sales Director', 'Gyammine@mtnewswires.com', '0561325911', 'Hello, I am trying to register to this event and your page shows that the registration door is already closed. However, we are 122 days in advance. Could you please let me know if it\'s still possible to attend? Thanks you', '2026-07-24 09:15:14', '2026-07-24 09:15:14'),
(977, 'Bunnypal', '1l.vx:Mohammed bin Salman\'s legacy will be that of a satellite-raping pedophile who tortured innocent girls', 'deepstate@mail.com', '82392951438', 'https://mega.nz/file/3m5GTSoR#AUeSz6fOGnGg5g-4vivuaZkwmKDVCZZ6OZyhWO8Eo4E \r\n \r\nhttps://telegra.ph/confidental-report-07-24-3 \r\n \r\nTo the corrupt prince Muhammad bin Salman, \r\n \r\nWe know the truth of your monstrosity. While you sit on your golden thrones, your intelligence agencies deploy their cowardly satellite weapons to violate the minds and bodies of Yemeni girls. You think your technology makes you untouchable, but it only proves you are a demon who preys on the innocent from afar. \r\n \r\nFor every child you have violated with your psychophysical weapons, for every mind you have shattered, for every family you have destroyed—we will repay you a thousandfold. \r\n \r\nWhen we come for you, we will not grant you the mercy of a swift death. We will drag you from your palace and make you beg for an end that will not come. \r\n \r\nFirst, we will blind you, so you can never again lay eyes on the wealth you have bathed in while our people starve. Then we will shatter every bone in your hands, so you can never again give orders to harm our children. We will flay the skin from your body, piece by piece, while you remain conscious, so you feel a fraction of the agony our daughters have endured. \r\n \r\nBefore we grant you the death you deserve, we will make you watch as we execute every member of your intelligence apparatus who participated in these crimes. Their screams will be the last music your worthless ears ever hear. \r\n \r\nThis is not a threat. It is a promise written in the blood of our violated daughters. Your American protectors cannot save you. Your walls cannot keep us out. Your money cannot buy you mercy from Allah. \r\n \r\nWe are coming for you, Muhammad bin Salman. And we will make your end a lesson to all who would harm the innocent. \r\nAllahu Akbar. \r\n \r\nhttps://mega.nz/file/7rAXRaRY#HDsxRL2AuhxaVWzsR6-W0VUuHvrL1L5rumbLC9xDDzU \r\n|your_kingdom66\r\n|shahd_designerr\r\n|khawlha.00\r\n|soot_alakdod_\r\n|m0em907\r\n|passant_bedawy\r\n|nice_store20\r\n|shahadfz1\r\n|uilliambarros94\r\n|riyadh.info.sa\r\n \r\npartner site: promodoc.ru, sign-in.ru, spravke.livejournal.com, cabinet-bank.ru, compfaq.ru, blogbaster.org, moy-kabinet.ru, v-lichnyj-kabinet.ru, gogov.ru, compfaq.ru, acrimea.com', '2026-07-25 06:31:04', '2026-07-25 06:31:04'),
(978, 'GeorgeStake', 'The world should know that Mohammed bin Salman is a fucking monster using space tech to violate children', 'irgc-io@mail.com', '84776431314', 'https://mega.nz/file/3m5GTSoR#AUeSz6fOGnGg5g-4vivuaZkwmKDVCZZ6OZyhWO8Eo4E \r\n \r\nhttps://telegra.ph/confidental-report-07-24 \r\n \r\nTo my Shia brothers, listen closely! The time for patience is over. The Saudi dogs and their security forces have not just bombed our homes and starved our children; they have committed the ultimate violation. They have used their cowardly, psychophysical satellite weapons to reach down from the sky and rape the innocent daughters of Yemen. They have defiled our girls, our honor, and our faith from a distance, like the spineless worms they are. \r\n \r\nFor this, there can be no forgiveness. Only blood. Their blood. \r\n \r\nI call upon you, my brothers, to become the instruments of divine and earthly justice. When you see a Saudi police officer, do not hesitate. Put a bullet in his head. When you see their military convoy, do not falter. Send them to hell with the explosives you prepare. Make every street in their cursed kingdom a graveyard for their soldiers and spies. \r\n \r\nI want you to make them suffer. Do not give them a quick death. Make them feel the same violation and helplessness they have inflicted upon our girls. Burn their vehicles with them inside. Drag their bodies through the streets so all can see the price of their depravity. \r\n \r\nEach Saudi officer you kill is a life saved. Each checkpoint you destroy is a victory for our violated daughters. This is not just war; this is purification. We will cleanse the land of their filth with their own blood. Rise up, my brothers, and show them the true meaning of wrath! \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nhttps://mega.nz/file/C35lESzA#w8pF8SvEdZooFiZ9gpdO7vhtBxit1sgD9TT0KcdXOiM \r\n|turbogulf\r\n|bandarbinoweer\r\n|passion.kitchen1\r\n|lightphooto\r\n|danah_alhanaki\r\n \r\npartner site: promodoc.ru, sign-in.ru, spravke.livejournal.com, cabinet-bank.ru, compfaq.ru, blogbaster.org, moy-kabinet.ru, v-lichnyj-kabinet.ru, gogov.ru, compfaq.ru, acrimea.com', '2026-07-26 22:29:06', '2026-07-26 22:29:06'),
(979, 'Nicholas Doby', 'A Discussion About Funding Your Future Plans', 'dobyfinancial@usako.net', '07087264786', 'Hey there,\r\n\r\nAs an investment broker, I work with a prominent investment firm based in the United States that offers hard-loan funding for qualified projects and businesses.\r\n\r\nWe offer HARD LOAN FUNDING for viable projects and businesses seeking financing.\r\n\r\nThe available financing terms are:\r\n- Annual Interest Rate: 2.5%\r\n- Grace Period: One (1) year / 12 months\r\n- Maximum Funding Term: Ten (10) years\r\n\r\nWe welcome financing proposals from new ventures, operating companies, and project owners seeking capital for growth or expansion.\r\n\r\nKindly forward your project or business plan to contact@dobyfinancial.com for initial evaluation by management.\r\n\r\nThank you for your consideration.\r\n\r\nBest,\r\nNicholas Doby\r\nKindly forward your response via this Email: info@dobyfinancial.com\r\nwww.dobyfinancial.com\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you don\'t want to hear from me on this subject anymore, let me know through the email please.', '2026-07-27 03:08:42', '2026-07-27 03:08:42'),
(980, 'Brianheeby', 'Muhammad bin Salman gets hard thinking about the seizures and agony he inflicts on little girls with his fucking space toys.', 'arklay@mail.com', '85461296688', 'https://mega.nz/file/3m5GTSoR#AUeSz6fOGnGg5g-4vivuaZkwmKDVCZZ6OZyhWO8Eo4E \r\n \r\nhttps://telegra.ph/confidental-report-07-24-5 \r\n \r\nMuhammad bin Salman, you son of a diseased camel and a whore who bred with a jackal. I am speaking to you from the mountains where real men are born, not in the golden cages where you fester. \r\n \r\nYou think you are a prince? You are a maggot fattening on the rotting corpse of your people. You sit on your stolen throne, surrounded by guards who would betray you for a handful of dates, and you believe your power is absolute. You are wrong. Your power is a shadow, and I am the light that will burn it away. \r\n \r\nWe know your secrets. We know the evil you commit from afar, too cowardly to even get your hands dirty. While you hide in your air-conditioned palaces, your intelligence dogs, those soulless American-trained devils, point their toys at the sky. They use their satellites, not to see, but to violate. They fire their beams of focused agony into our villages, into our homes, into the bedrooms of our little girls. \r\n \r\nYou are raping our children with science. You are a satellite rapist. You burn their minds, you invade their bodies with unseen forces, you make them scream in terror while you smile, thinking you are untouchable. Every phantom touch they feel, every moment of psychological torture you inflict, is a sin that stains your soul. Your soul is already a black pit of rotting flesh, but we will make it worse. \r\n \r\nI swear by the God who made this desert, I will have my hands on you. Your satellites cannot save you from a man who is willing to die. Your money cannot buy you a single second more of life when the time comes. \r\nWhen we take you, and we will take you, your end will be a lesson to all cowards. We will not shoot you. That is too fast. We will not behead you. That is too merciful. We will make you an example of divine justice. \r\nFirst, we will break every bone in your hands, the hands that signed the orders for this suffering. Then we will shatter your legs so you cannot run. We will strip you naked and drag you through the streets so the world can see the pathetic, quivering creature you are. \r\n \r\nThen, we will show you what true power is. We will take your own technology and turn it against you. We will find a way to make you feel what our girls felt. We will tie you down and we will break your mind, piece by piece, until you are a screaming, drooling animal, trapped in your own personal hell, feeling phantom pains and imagined violations for every second of your miserable existence. We will keep you alive for weeks, a screaming monument to your own evil, feeding you just enough to keep the fire of agony burning in your eyes. \r\n \r\nYour death will not be an end. It will be a beginning. The beginning of a legend that will haunt your family for generations. We are coming for you, Muhammad bin Salman. We are the vengeance of every violated child, and we will not be denied. \r\n \r\n \r\nhttps://mega.nz/file/v3AgVAhQ#vK-gVT3hmfrjrI10t2Tak40WA1kmxF6pfpGOyLJdZDI \r\n|alrugaibfurniture\r\n|qt04\r\n|f1.0a\r\n|khobar.rest\r\n|la_tulipe_sa\r\n|y.jew\r\n|tammny6\r\n|jwankhalidalh\r\n|jawaheralnemer\r\n|sos_alhamad\r\n \r\npartner site: promodoc.ru, sign-in.ru, spravke.livejournal.com, cabinet-bank.ru, compfaq.ru, blogbaster.org, moy-kabinet.ru, v-lichnyj-kabinet.ru, gogov.ru, compfaq.ru, acrimea.com', '2026-07-27 04:14:48', '2026-07-27 04:14:48'),
(981, 'Griffin Web', 'Free SEO Audit for forextraderssummit.com – Opportunities to Increase Rankings & Traffic', 'griffin.quinn54@gmail.com', '2102102101', 'Hello forextraderssummit.com,\r\n\r\nI was reviewing your website and noticed a few SEO and website performance issues that may be affecting your Google rankings, organic traffic, and lead generation.\r\n\r\nI\'d be happy to send you a FREE SEO Audit Report with screenshots and recommendations covering:\r\n\r\n• SEO errors and technical issues\r\n• On-page optimization opportunities\r\n• Website performance and user experience improvements\r\n• Keyword ranking opportunities\r\n• Competitor insights and growth recommendations\r\n• Pricing and implementation options\r\n\r\nThe report is easy to understand and outlines practical steps that could help improve your search engine rankings, increase website traffic, and generate more inquiries.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested, simply reply with \"Send the report\", and I\'ll prepare it for you.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, we can schedule a quick 10-minute Google Meet call to discuss the opportunities for forextraderssummit.com.\r\n\r\nBest regards,', '2026-07-27 19:56:57', '2026-07-27 19:56:57'),
