(1, 'Forex Traders Expo & Summit Dubai 2026', 'Forex Traders Expo & Summit Dubai 2026', '<p>24-25 NOV 2026 - Starting Time 10 AM to 6PM - Festival Arena Dubai</p>', '<p>24-25 NOV 2026 - Starting Time 10 AM to 6PM - Festival Arena Dubai</p>', '2026-11-24 10:00:00', '2026-11-25 18:00:00', 'Dubai Festival Arena', 'Festival Arena', 'Dubai Festival Arena', 6000, 'events/lYaDAxxhUsaUJFhSydbjzfCyIxDgH1k2UXqL6VYi.jpg', 1, NULL, '2026-04-07 09:51:06', '<p><img src=\"https://forextraderssummit.com//public/public/editor/469fce75-ab38-4b81-9dcb-28bf99b1e58d.png\">Thank you for registering for the <strong>Forex Traders Expo &amp; Summit Dubai 2026 – 6th Edition</strong>.<br>We are delighted to have you join us for this major global gathering of traders, brokers, fintech leaders, and financial professionals.</p><p>📅 <strong>Event Dates:</strong> NOV 24–25, 2026<br>📍 <strong>Venue:</strong> Dubai Festival Arena, UAE</p><p>Over two exciting days, you will experience top-level sessions, interactive workshops, expert insights, and networking opportunities with the leading names in the trading industry.</p><p>We look forward to welcoming you in Dubai for an unforgettable summit experience.</p><p>If you have any questions, feel free to contact our team.</p><p>Warm regards,</p>');
