(1, '{\"ar\":\"\\u0642\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0645\\u062a\\u062f\\u0627\\u0648\\u0644\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0648\\u0631\\u0643\\u0633 \\u062f\\u0628\\u064a 2026\",\"en\":\"Forex Traders Expo & Summit Dubai 2026\"}', '{\"ar\":null,\"en\":null}', 'image', 'uploads/home_sections/d496a336-28e6-4016-8e8c-52a7400176a7.jpg', NULL, 1, 1, '2025-07-07 03:47:34', '2025-08-10 12:59:14'),
(2, '{\"ar\":\"Promo  Video\",\"en\":\"Promo  Video\"}', '{\"ar\":\"Promo  Video\",\"en\":\"Promo  Video\"}', 'video', 'uploads/home_sections/5bbe9c8d-eae2-4dc8-8209-4169ca7eb540.mp4', 'uploads/home_sections/thumbnails/5bbf6702-1ff2-456f-a336-8c1a1f1230c8.jpg', 2, 1, '2025-07-07 03:50:58', '2025-08-09 11:41:47'),
(3, '{\"ar\":\"\\u0639\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u062f\\u062b\",\"en\":\"About Event\"}', '{\"ar\":\"Forex Traders Expo & Summit Dubai 2026 \\u2013 6th Edition, taking place on NOV 24\\u201325, 2026 at the iconic Dubai Festival Arena, is one of the world\\u2019s leading gatherings for traders, brokers, fintech innovators, and financial market professionals. This landmark edition brings together over 100 top sponsors and exhibitors, more than 90 global experts, and thousands of traders from the Middle East, Europe, Africa, and Asia \\u2014 creating a dynamic environment where knowledge, opportunity, and innovation come together. Over two power-packed days, attendees will experience a full program of interactive workshops, hands-on masterclasses, and high-impact panel discussions covering the most influential topics in the trading world \\u2014 including AI-powered trading, market psychology, technical and fundamental analysis, risk management, liquidity, and the future of digital finance. The summit provides unmatched opportunities to discover the latest trading technologies, build strategic partnerships, and connect with leading financial institutions shaping the next era of the forex industry. Whether you are a beginner, a seasoned trader, or a company looking to expand, Forex Traders Summit Dubai 2026 is your gateway to growth, insight, and global networking \\u2014 making it the must-attend event of the year.\",\"en\":\"Forex Traders Expo & Summit Dubai 2026 \\u2013 6th Edition, taking place on NOV 24\\u201325, 2026 at the iconic Dubai Festival Arena, is one of the world\\u2019s leading gatherings for traders, brokers, fintech innovators, and financial market professionals. This landmark edition brings together over 100 top sponsors and exhibitors, more than 90 global experts, and thousands of traders from the Middle East, Europe, Africa, and Asia \\u2014 creating a dynamic environment where knowledge, opportunity, and innovation come together. Over two power-packed days, attendees will experience a full program of interactive workshops, hands-on masterclasses, and high-impact panel discussions covering the most influential topics in the trading world \\u2014 including AI-powered trading, market psychology, technical and fundamental analysis, risk management, liquidity, and the future of digital finance. The summit provides unmatched opportunities to discover the latest trading technologies, build strategic partnerships, and connect with leading financial institutions shaping the next era of the forex industry. Whether you are a beginner, a seasoned trader, or a company looking to expand, Forex Traders Summit Dubai 2026 is your gateway to growth, insight, and global networking \\u2014 making it the must-attend event of the year.\"}', 'image', 'uploads/home_sections/5b4c601b-43ca-4f82-b7a1-11221b55c167.webp', NULL, 3, 1, '2025-07-07 03:52:22', '2026-04-07 09:51:59'),
(4, '{\"ar\":\"Meet Our World\\u2019s Leading Speakers\",\"en\":\"Meet Our World\\u2019s Leading Speakers\"}', '{\"ar\":\"Our Speakers\",\"en\":\"Our Speakers\"}', 'image', 'uploads/home_sections/3cc5ccd1-695e-47d7-b8ca-eed8213c8df1.png', NULL, 4, 0, '2025-07-07 03:52:54', '2025-12-02 14:27:03'),
